.claude/agents
engram-dev
.atl/
.release-notes-beta.md

# The locally built binary the MCP config points at. It is 28 MB and it is
# rebuilt from source, so it never belongs in the history.
bin/

# Regenerable code graph, never versioned.
graphify-out/

# Throwaway output from the dockerized dev/validation environment.
docker/dev/out/

# Compiled binaries that a stray `go build` inside the package directory
# leaves behind. `go build ./cmd/engram` writes to the current directory, so
# running it from inside cmd/engram drops a 17 MB executable named after the
# package right next to the sources.
cmd/engram/main
cmd/engram/gentle-creation
